@100 = ~Repair Sword Coast Stratagems caster AI that misses some IWD:EE casters~
@110 = ~Party banter starts only between living party members in one area (stops a crash with the Crossmod Banter Pack)~
@120 = ~Baldur's Gate spell rules and fixes (caster-level Dispel/Remove Magic, Minor Spell Deflection L1-4, non-stacking Mirror/Reflected/Spirit Armor, AoE Mirror Image bypass, logical Web/Grease/Stinking Cloud/Spook/Horror immunities, Universal utility schools)~
@200 = ~Enemy priests prepare when they first see the party (Core Rules and up)~
@300 = ~Belhifet's final fight: no blanket spell immunity, more hit points by difficulty, his cornugons as a second wave~
@310 = ~Yxunomei's temple: her mages come when the fight starts, her champions join her, yuan-ti elites on Hard and Insane~
@320 = ~The orog raid on Kuldahar: the raid moves as one and hunts the party, its leaders charge after a war horn~
@330 = ~Joril's throne room: more hit points for Joril, Berserker rage and Hold Person for his court, Gorg's pack defends him~
@340 = ~Maiden Ilmadia's forge: her Blackguard abilities, more hit points, her giants gather at her side~
@350 = ~The Idol: one spell per round on cooldowns and only where it works, more hit points, its undead come when it is attacked~
@360 = ~Poquelin in the Ascension Cave: more hit points, a jump with Fire Storm and the next wave at three quarters, no outright death~
@370 = ~Cryshal-Tirith: Pomab's images look like him and hide him again after every hit, his sentries guard him~
@380 = ~Mebdinga's barrow: her wails come on time, an honour guard of wights and drowned dead, a Lament below half on Hard and Insane~
@390 = ~Icasaracht's lair: more hit points for her and her soul gem, no second gem, the second underpriestess repaired~
@400 = ~Lord Maluradek: his banishment rooms fill with animated plates that fight, more hit points, all rooms awake below half~
@410 = ~The Luremaster: he opens with Improved Invisibility, hops away when an enemy reaches him, his Dispel Magic works~
@420 = ~Main campaign overhaul (Ch. 2-6): curated filler thinning, Drasus/Iron-Throne-style squads, Severed Hand/Terikan/AR3503/Tarnsen/DGINA2 fixes~
@500 = ~Heart of Winter & Trials of the Luremaster: curated encounters, thinned hordes, and AR9602 repair~

